{
  "name": "dsh-porthole",
  "version": "1.5.1",
  "description": "DSH 本机门户：反向代理 + 双密码门禁 + 会话投影剥离 + 远程工作区管理，支持 nginx 子域名/二级目录，可绑定指定网卡。",
  "releaseNotes": "【v1.5.1】trustedProxies 语义调整：本地回环（127.0.0.1 / ::1）改为不可移除的可信基线，自定义数组在其上追加而非整体替换；空数组 [] 仍信任回环。此前自定义 trustedProxies 会连本机回环一并排除、导致同机 nginx 上报的 X-Forwarded-Prefix 被忽略；升级后同机 nginx 无需再手动列入回环地址。非法配置（主机名/端口/网段）仍 fail-closed、门户不启动。测试：12 项核心用例全部通过。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./locale/*": "./locale/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "GAP-REPORT.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build:client": "node client/build.mjs",
    "prepack": "npm run build:client",
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "qrcode": "^1.5.3"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2",
    "react": "^18.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^18.3.1"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
